{"kftadDitasamasasca": [{"id": "kfttadDitasamAsASca", "headword": "कृत्तद्धितसमासाश्च", "headword_slp1": "kfttadDitasamAsASca", "fold": "kftadDitasamasasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The forms ending कृत् affixes or तद्धित affixes, or compound are also called प्रातिपदिक।\n\nTerms: प्रातिपदिक", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्तद्धितसमासाश्च १.२.४६", "१.२.४६", "१.२.४६ कृत्तद्धितसमासाश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kfttadDitasamAsASca १.२.४६", "१.२.४६", "१.२.४६ kfttadDitasamAsASca"]}], "kftyEraDikarTavacane": [{"id": "kftyEraDikArTavacane", "headword": "कृत्यैरधिकार्थवचने", "headword_slp1": "kftyEraDikArTavacane", "fold": "kftyEraDikarTavacane", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A word ending with the Instrumental -3rd case-affix when it denotes the agent or the Instrument, is compounded optionally with a word ending in a कृत्य affix, when exaggerated statement (wether of praise or of censure) is implied and the resulting compound is तत्-पुरुष ।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यैरधिकार्थवचने २.१.३३", "२.१.३३", "२.१.३३ कृत्यैरधिकार्थवचने"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyEraDikArTavacane २.१.३३", "२.१.३३", "२.१.३३ kftyEraDikArTavacane"]}], "kftyErfRe": [{"id": "kftyErfRe", "headword": "कृत्यैर्ऋणे", "headword_slp1": "kftyErfRe", "fold": "kftyErfRe", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A word ending with the Locative -7th-case-affix is compounded with words ending with कृत्य-affix (a Future Passive Participle) and the resulting compound is तत्-पुरुष ।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यैर्ऋणे २.१.४३", "२.१.४३", "२.१.४३ कृत्यैर्ऋणे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyErfRe २.१.४३", "२.१.४३", "२.१.४३ kftyErfRe"]}], "kftyatulyaKya ajatya": [{"id": "kftyatulyAKyA ajAtyA", "headword": "कृत्यतुल्याख्या अजात्या", "headword_slp1": "kftyatulyAKyA ajAtyA", "fold": "kftyatulyaKya ajatya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "Words ending with कृत् -affix and the word तुल्य 'equal' and its synonyms are compounded with words which do not denote genus (जाति) being in the same case with them and the resulting compound is तत्-पुरुष ।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यतुल्याख्या अजात्या २.१.६८", "२.१.६८", "२.१.६८ कृत्यतुल्याख्या अजात्या"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyatulyAKyA ajAtyA २.१.६८", "२.१.६८", "२.१.६८ kftyatulyAKyA ajAtyA"]}], "kftvorTaprayoge kaleDikaraRe": [{"id": "kftvo'rTaprayoge kAle'DikaraRe", "headword": "कृत्वोऽर्थप्रयोगे कालेऽधिकरणे", "headword_slp1": "kftvo'rTaprayoge kAle'DikaraRe", "fold": "kftvorTaprayoge kaleDikaraRe", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The 6th-Case-affix is used in denoting location (अधिकरण) after a word denoting time (काल) when used along with a word ending with an affix having the sense of कृत्वसुच् -- संख्यायाः क्रियाऽभ्यावृत्तिगणने कृत्वसुच् ५.४.१७ 'so many times'.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-6", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्वोऽर्थप्रयोगे कालेऽधिकरणे २.३.६४", "२.३.६४", "२.३.६४ कृत्वोऽर्थप्रयोगे कालेऽधिकरणे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftvo'rTaprayoge kAle'DikaraRe २.३.६४", "२.३.६४", "२.३.६४ kftvo'rTaprayoge kAle'DikaraRe"]}], "kftyanan kartari va": [{"id": "kftyAnAM kartari vA", "headword": "कृत्यानां कर्तरि वा", "headword_slp1": "kftyAnAM kartari vA", "fold": "kftyanan kartari va", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The 6th-Case-affix is optionally used in denoting the agent, (but not the object), when the word is governed by a Future Passive Participle (कृत्य).\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-6", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यानां कर्तरि वा २.३.७१", "२.३.७१", "२.३.७१ कृत्यानां कर्तरि वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyAnAM kartari vA २.३.७१", "२.३.७१", "२.३.७१ kftyAnAM kartari vA"]}], "kftyaH praN RvulaH": [{"id": "kftyAH prAN RvulaH", "headword": "कृत्याः प्राङ् ण्वुलः", "headword_slp1": "kftyAH prAN RvulaH", "fold": "kftyaH praN RvulaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "From this sūtra up to ण्वुल्तृचौ ३.१.१३३ all the affixes treated will get the name कृत्य।\n\nTerms: कृत्य", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्याः प्राङ् ण्वुलः ३.१.९५", "३.१.९५", "३.१.९५ कृत्याः प्राङ् ण्वुलः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyAH prAN RvulaH ३.१.९५", "३.१.९५", "३.१.९५ kftyAH prAN RvulaH"]}], "kftyalyuwo bahulam": [{"id": "kftyalyuwo bahulam", "headword": "कृत्यल्युटो बहुलम्", "headword_slp1": "kftyalyuwo bahulam", "fold": "kftyalyuwo bahulam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes called कृत्य -- कृत्याः प्राङ् ण्वुलः ३.१.९५, and the affix ल्युट् , are diversely applicable and have other senses than those taught before.\n\nTerms: कृत्य", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यल्युटो बहुलम् ३.३.११३", "३.३.११३", "३.३.११३ कृत्यल्युटो बहुलम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyalyuwo bahulam ३.३.११३", "३.३.११३", "३.३.११३ kftyalyuwo bahulam"]}], "kftyasca": [{"id": "kftyASca", "headword": "कृत्याश्च", "headword_slp1": "kftyASca", "fold": "kftyasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes called कृत्य also come after a root when the sense to be indicated is that of 'necessity' or 'obligation'.\n\nTerms: कृत्य", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्याश्च ३.३.१७१", "३.३.१७१", "३.३.१७१ कृत्याश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyASca ३.३.१७१", "३.३.१७१", "३.३.१७१ kftyASca"]}], "kftyarTe tavEkenkenyatvanaH": [{"id": "kftyArTe tavEkenkenyatvanaH", "headword": "कृत्यार्थे तवैकेन्केन्यत्वनः", "headword_slp1": "kftyArTe tavEkenkenyatvanaH", "fold": "kftyarTe tavEkenkenyatvanaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes 1. तवै 2. केन् 3. केन्य 4. त्वन् are added to roots in the छन्दस् (Vedas), in the sense of कृत्य-affixes.\n\nTerms: तवै-केन्-केन्य-त्वन्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यार्थे तवैकेन्केन्यत्वनः ३.४.१४", "३.४.१४", "३.४.१४ कृत्यार्थे तवैकेन्केन्यत्वनः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyArTe tavEkenkenyatvanaH ३.४.१४", "३.४.१४", "३.४.१४ kftyArTe tavEkenkenyatvanaH"]}], "kftalabDakritakusalaH": [{"id": "kftalabDakrItakuSalAH", "headword": "कृतलब्धक्रीतकुशलाः", "headword_slp1": "kftalabDakrItakuSalAH", "fold": "kftalabDakritakusalaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "An affix (one of those already taught) comes after a word in the Locative -7th case, in the sense of 'done there', 'obtained there', 'bought there' and 'dexterous therein'.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-7", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृतलब्धक्रीतकुशलाः ४.३.३८", "४.३.३८", "४.३.३८ कृतलब्धक्रीतकुशलाः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftalabDakrItakuSalAH ४.३.३८", "४.३.३८", "४.३.३८ kftalabDakrItakuSalAH"]}], "kfte granTe": [{"id": "kfte granTe", "headword": "कृते ग्रन्थे", "headword_slp1": "kfte granTe", "fold": "kfte granTe", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "An affix comes after a word in the Instrumental -3rd case in construction in the sense of 'made', the thing made being 'a book'.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-3", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृते ग्रन्थे ४.३.११६", "४.३.११६", "४.३.११६ कृते ग्रन्थे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kfte granTe ४.३.११६", "४.३.११६", "४.३.११६ kfte granTe"]}], "kftyokesRucarvadayasca": [{"id": "kftyokezRuccArvAdayaSca", "headword": "कृत्योकेष्णुच्चार्वादयश्च", "headword_slp1": "kftyokezRuccArvAdayaSca", "fold": "kftyokesRucarvadayasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the Negative Particle, the words formed by the कृत्य affixes -- कृत्याः प्राङ् ण्वुलः ३.१.९५, by उक and इष्णुच् and the words चारु etc. have acute accent (उदात्त) on the final.\n\nTerms: समास end acute-2nd-term", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्योकेष्णुच्चार्वादयश्च ६.२.१६०", "६.२.१६०", "६.२.१६० कृत्योकेष्णुच्चार्वादयश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyokezRuccArvAdayaSca ६.२.१६०", "६.२.१६०", "६.२.१६० kftyokezRuccArvAdayaSca"]}], "kftyacaH": [{"id": "kftyacaH", "headword": "कृत्यचः", "headword_slp1": "kftyacaH", "fold": "kftyacaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The न of कृत् affix, preceded by a vowel, is changed into ण , when it follows an उपसर्ग having the cause of change.\n\nTerms: सन्धि-हल्-word-उपसर्ग", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृत्यचः ८.४.२९", "८.४.२९", "८.४.२९ कृत्यचः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftyacaH ८.४.२९", "८.४.२९", "८.४.२९ kftyacaH"]}]}